Subject: [Linux-kernel-mentees] [PATCH v2 07/15] scsi: hisi_sas_v3_hw: use
	generic power management
X-BeenThere: linux-kernel-mentees@lists.linuxfoundation.org
X-Mailman-Version: 2.1.15
